# .gitattributes — Git LFS filter rules
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# C3 consolidation (2026-04-19): all prior LFS filter rules were DEAD.
# Prior rules tracked *.sqlite, *.zip, *.pkl, *.gz and artifacts/adg/* as LFS,
# but those extensions + the artifacts/ tree are now in .gitignore, so no file
# matching them is ever tracked by git. `git lfs ls-files` + `git ls-files`
# both returned empty at the time of pruning.
#
# If LFS tracking is reintroduced in future:
#   1. Remove the path from config/excluded_paths.yaml / .gitignore first
#   2. Add a filter=lfs rule here
#   3. Run `git lfs track <pattern>` so git registers the filter
